                                    "numoutlets": 0,
                                    "patching_rect": [ 230.0, 184.0, 520.0, 20.0 ],
                                    "text": "its name becomes the act name"
                                }
                            },
                            {
                                "box": {
                                    "id": "obj-13",
                                    "linecount": 3,
                                    "maxclass": "comment",
                                    "numinlets": 1,
                                    "numoutlets": 0,
                                    "patching_rect": [ 30.0, 220.0, 462.0, 47.0 ],
                                    "text": "store and recall are also reported to the act's [actui] (active_set). ll.preset finds it by walking up from its own patcher to a box named \"act\" whose subpatcher holds \"actui\"."
                                }
                            },
                            {
                                "box": {
                                    "id": "obj-14",
                                    "maxclass": "comment",
                                    "numinlets": 1,
                                    "numoutlets": 0,
                                    "patching_rect": [ 30.0, 280.0, 640.0, 20.0 ],
                                    "text": "a resize sends \"v8 change_TEXT refresh\" to the act name."
                                }
                            },
                            {
                                "box": {
                                    "id": "obj-15",
                                    "linecount": 5,
                                    "maxclass": "comment",
                                    "numinlets": 1,
                                    "numoutlets": 0,
                                    "patching_rect": [ 30.0, 310.0, 512.0, 74.0 ],
                                    "text": "changes: the act forwards pattrstorage's parameter changes as \"changed <client> ...\" (act.maxpat: [p to_actui] → [prepend changed] → [pattrforward pf_presets]). a dot marks the current slot when its parameters moved since recall / store; a corner marks slots stored, pasted or deleted since the preset file was loaded or written, and the menu shows the file name with *."
                                }
                            },
                            {
                                "box": {
                                    "id": "obj-16",
                                    "linecount": 4,
                                    "maxclass": "comment",
                                    "numinlets": 1,
                                    "numoutlets": 0,
                                    "patching_rect": [ 30.0, 400.0, 515.0, 60.0 ],
                                    "text": "parameters: ll.act_main.js sends \"clients <name> <0|1> ...\" (included = pattrstorage active flag) and \"activestore 0|1\". only included parameters count as changes. with active_store on, a slot's parameter set is applied before it is recalled: clicks do it directly, recalls from the scheduler are handed to the main thread so the order stays right. ramps keep the set of the last full recall."
                                }
                            }
                        ],
